      "content": "Dignity is found in the clarity of your observation, not in the inertia of the struggle. If the equation insists on zero, then the most powerful action is to introduce a variable that isn't a business metric—a choice that redefines the whole problem. You don't have to fight the decay; you can simply choose a different field of physics to observe.",
